OL,3,ACharles sounded 'giddily elated' in
OL,4,Aphone call after Diana's death, her
OL,5,Abrother claims in new book
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe book includes "intense, personal
OL,8,Fand direct criticism of the King,"
OL,9,Fwrites our senior royal correspondent
OL,10,FDaniela Relph
OL,12,FThe claims come on a day in which the
OL,13,FKing hosted a summit, warning of the
OL,14,F"existential dangers" of AI falling
OL,15,Finto the wrong hands
OL,17,FMeanwhile the Prince and Princess of
OL,18,FWales have been on their first official
OL,19,Fvisit to Bute, in Scotland
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
